   "triggerComment": [
    "The obligation to notify was triggered by a disposal of shares (Acquisition Position Obligation). With Recommendations of the Disclosure Office dated 15 July 2016, 17 June 2019, 8 July 2022 and 11 July 2025, BlackRock, Inc. was granted easing provisions from the obligation to disclose the direct shareholders according to Article 120 para. 1 FinMIA in conjunction with Article 11 let. b and Article 22 para. 1 let. e and para. 3 FinMIO-FINMA when disclosing holdings according to Article 18 para. 1 and 4 FinMIO-FINMA. However, collective investment schemes within the meaning of Article 18 para. 2 let. a FinMIO-FINMA that hold individually 3% or more of the voting rights of the relevant issuer will be mentioned in the relevant disclosure notification. Any person shall, at his/her request and without prove of interest, receive information about the direct shareholders within the meaning of Article 11 let. b an Article 22 para. 1 let. e and para. 3 FinMIO-FINMA.  Such request has to be addressed via email to the Disclosure Office: disclosure-office@six-group.com. The information will be provided in electronic format with a reference date not older than one month.  The easing provisions are granted until 15 July 2028."
